# ----- Payment (required) -----
# EVM address that receives USDC payments for every paid request.
PAY_TO_ADDRESS=0xYourAddressHere

# Payment network: base-sepolia (testnet, default) or base (mainnet).
# NETWORK=base-sepolia

# x402 facilitator that verifies and settles payments.
# Default https://x402.org/facilitator works for base-sepolia.
# For mainnet you need a mainnet facilitator (e.g. via CDP).
# FACILITATOR_URL=https://x402.org/facilitator

# ----- Server -----
# PORT=4021

# ----- Kroger API (optional — unlocks live data) -----
# Free developer account: https://developer.kroger.com
# When unset, the server serves deterministic fixture data labeled source: "fixture".
# KROGER_CLIENT_ID=
# KROGER_CLIENT_SECRET=
# Override the API base (e.g. certification env). Default: https://api.kroger.com/v1
# KROGER_BASE_URL=

# ----- Client example (examples/agent-client.ts) -----
# Private key of the wallet that PAYS for requests (needs base-sepolia USDC).
# Testnet USDC faucet: https://faucet.circle.com
# PRIVATE_KEY=0x...
# Base URL of the server to call.
# BASE_URL=http://localhost:4021
